{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026WQz9amXaQ91794521081.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>觀塘發生懷疑劫案，一名男子額頭受傷，清醒送院治理。</p><p></p><p>案發現場有血漬，有沾染血漬的衣物和手套。</p><p></p><p>案發在凌晨一點半，觀塘輔仁街8號大廈對出，一名男子自行報案，聲稱被賊人打劫及刺傷，額頭有約8厘米傷口流血，他送往伊利沙伯醫院治理。</p><p></p><p>有警員進入大廈了解，案件起因有待調查。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T23:04:26.521504+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T20:03:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T02:07:16.592302+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T22:57:39.450798+00:00","content_hash":"c13e942293b4c55a6143ec56baec2b8ec02991d8f4df15438f6737b8c92f2739","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T23:04:26.521504+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}